  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Snap Cloud Connected needs your Snap Cloud credentials: assign a SupabaseProject on SnapCloudConnected and run Supabase/snapcloud-connected-setup.sql once.
    One player taps Host and reads out the 4-digit code; the other taps Join and enters those 4 digits. Each player then places the play area on their own surface and taps Ready.
    Once everyone is ready, grab a cube and it moves for both players: the red cube belongs to the host, the blue one to the guest, and anyone can move the white one.
